    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Old School Fantasy FPS</h2><br>     <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532660/extras/0d1e4f5587e85cb99f5ecf11ed09a94f.webp?t=1478219000\" /></div><br>You find yourself on a small floating island. A grumpy old man introduces you to your new gained powers. <br>During the game you learn new spells by defeating increasingly difficult monsters. <br>The ultimate goal is to defeat the dragon to be able to return to reality. <br><br>     <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532660/extras/8d1755c1ce9e303a2f9138bb5994b79a.webp?t=1478219000\" /></div><br>The Survival Mode throws 20 increasingly difficult waves of monsters at you. <br>Fight for a highscore in the online leaderboard by surviving as long as possible!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\t5 versatile spells as weapons  <br></li><li>\t10+ enemy types in two unique environments<br></li><li>\tFully dynamic lighting and weather<br></li><li>\tNo time wasted! Short, polished experience</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Old School Fantasy FPS</h2><br>     <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532660/extras/0d1e4f5587e85cb99f5ecf11ed09a94f.webp?t=1478219000\" /></div><br>You find yourself on a small floating island. A grumpy old man introduces you to your new gained powers. <br>During the game you learn new spells by defeating increasingly difficult monsters. <br>The ultimate goal is to defeat the dragon to be able to return to reality. <br><br>     <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/532660/extras/8d1755c1ce9e303a2f9138bb5994b79a.webp?t=1478219000\" /></div><br>The Survival Mode throws 20 increasingly difficult waves of monsters at you. <br>Fight for a highscore in the online leaderboard by surviving as long as possible!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\t5 versatile spells as weapons  <br></li><li>\t10+ enemy types in two unique environments<br></li><li>\tFully dynamic lighting and weather<br></li><li>\tNo time wasted! Short, polished experience</li></ul>",
